<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.39272.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.39272.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.39272, versus 1.38985 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.40147  (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	8.10382   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	159.606   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.834314   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.85251   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    16.8993   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     49.5391   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.93699   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     9.14251   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3405.20   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	2435.71   (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2346.84   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.420699   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.70188   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  10.0910   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.21574   (4.25788)</p>
<p> S.A. Rand	   6.26794   (0.80200)</p>
